--- (3) THE LOMAX SHAPE TEST: u = g/s, CDF 1-(1+u)^-2 (PDF 2(1+u)^-3) ---
    s (scale) = the mass-weighted mean g -- the shape-2 Lomax moment E[u] = 1 => E[g] = s; ONE estimated parameter (chi2 dof corrected).
