  V2 the Lomax-shape test (the FULL distribution):
      SPARC shells (full)          KS p = 0.000, mass-frac chi2 = 1.25/8 (p_mc 0.01)
      HI mass elements             KS p = 0.233, mass-frac chi2 = 0.71/8 (p_mc 0.89)
